      content: 'After the appointment, the patient\'s 18-year-old daughter calls the clinic and asks to speak with you privately. She says: "My dad told me about his diagnosis. I\'m about to go to college and I need to know if I\'m going to get this disease. I want to get tested but I don\'t want my parents to know. Can you order the test for me?"',
